         <title>Masters of PixInsight V8 Scripts v1.5.3</title>
         <description>
            <p>v1.5.3 — Two bugfixes found during user testing:
            NBRGBCombination's Apply button had a stray "this.this.dialog"
            typo that threw an error every time it was clicked (pre-existing
            in the original script, not V8-specific); Combine Two Views
            still had one deprecated gc(true) call left over from the
            original migration pass. 27 scripts total.</p>
         </description>
      </package>
